---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Fabiano Rosa | Senior Enterprise Architect, SAP & Java"
  description="Fabiano Rosa is a Senior Enterprise Architect and Technology Leader with 25+ years of experience in SAP, Java, cloud architecture, and AI-enabled enterprise transformation."
>
  <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-200 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4">
      <a href="#hero" class="text-2xl font-bold">Fabiano Rosa</a>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
        <li><a href="#about" class="hover:text-blue-600">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#expertise" class="hover:text-blue-600">Expertise</a></li>
        <li><a href="#experience" class="hover:text-blue-600">Experience</a></li>
        <li><a href="#projects" class="hover:text-blue-600">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-blue-600">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="container text-center">
      <img src="/fabiano.jpg" alt="Fabiano Rosa" class="mx-auto mb-8 h-48 w-48 rounded-full object-cover" />
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-6xl">Fabiano Rosa</h1>
      <p class="mb-8 text-xl text-gray-600 md:text-2xl">
        Senior Enterprise Architect &amp; Technology Leader<br />
        SAP BTP | Java Architecture | AI-enabled Transformation
      </p>
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg text-gray-600">The Hague, Netherlands · 25+ years in technology</p>
      <a
        href="mailto:fabianorosa1@gmail.com"
        class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="container">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold">About Me</h2>
      <p class="mb-6 text-xl leading-relaxed">
        I’m a Senior Enterprise Architect and Technology Leader with more than 25 years of experience
        designing and delivering enterprise software and platforms. At Shell, I help shape scalable,
        secure technology solutions, with a focus on SAP architecture, SAP Business Technology Platform
        (BTP), Java, and cloud transformation.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed">
        My current focus is bringing AI into enterprise transformation: connecting promising business
        use cases with sound architecture, SAP and cloud integration, security, and governance. I have
        recently completed AI-focused certifications and continue to deepen my knowledge as the field
        evolves. My background also includes applied research on PaaS migration and cloud-native software
        development.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="expertise" class="container">
      <h2 class="mb-12 text-4xl font-bold">Expertise</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">AI &amp; Enterprise Transformation</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>AI architecture and adoption in enterprise environments</li>
            <li>AI-enabled business transformation and use-case discovery</li>
            <li>Integration of AI capabilities across SAP and cloud landscapes</li>
            <li>Security, governance, and responsible AI adoption</li>
            <li>Recent AI-focused certifications and continuous learning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">SAP &amp; Enterprise Architecture</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Enterprise architecture, platform strategy, and technical leadership</li>
            <li>SAP BTP, SAP S/4HANA, and Clean Core architecture</li>
            <li>Cloud integration, APIs, and side-by-side extensibility</li>
            <li>SAPUI5, Fiori, OData, and identity (XSUAA, OAuth2)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Java &amp; Software Architecture</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Java architecture and enterprise application design</li>
            <li>Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, and OData services</li>
            <li>Cloud-native modernization and distributed systems</li>
            <li>Event-driven integration and architecture documentation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Cloud &amp; Delivery</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>SAP BTP and Cloud Foundry</li>
            <li>CI/CD, GitHub Actions, Maven, and automation</li>
            <li>Structurizr and architecture diagrams as code</li>
            <li>Secure, maintainable solution design</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experience" class="container">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold">Experience</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Senior Enterprise Architect &amp; Technology Leader</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-lg text-gray-600">Shell · The Hague, Netherlands</p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Providing architectural leadership for enterprise platforms and transformation, with a
            strong focus on SAP BTP strategy, scalable cloud solutions, integration, and the evolving
            role of AI in business processes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Enterprise Architecture &amp; Software Engineering</h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-lg text-gray-600">25+ years across international teams and technology environments</p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Built a career spanning enterprise architecture, SAP landscapes, and Java software
            engineering. Work includes platform and solution design, cloud and PaaS modernization,
            enterprise integration, and technical leadership.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="container">
      <h2 class="mb-12 text-4xl font-bold">Projects &amp; Open Source</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-8 transition hover:shadow-lg md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="mb-2 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700">Featured · AI + SAP BTP</p>
              <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">SAP BTP Change Intelligence Agent</h3>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/fabianorosa1/btp-change-intelligence-quarkus"
              class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
            >
              View project on GitHub →
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            A Java 25 and Quarkus application that turns SAP BTP release changes into actionable
            architecture insight. It combines deterministic triage against an enterprise service
            catalogue with AI-assisted impact assessments, then routes the results to human architecture
            review. The dashboard brings assessments, pending decisions, service catalogue, and operations
            into one place.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Built with Quarkus LangChain4j and a Vite dashboard using SAP UI5 Web Components, the solution
            keeps enterprise relevance grounded in catalogue evidence while applying guardrails to AI
            recommendations. It demonstrates a human-in-the-loop approach to AI for SAP platform change
            management.
          </p>
          <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
            <figure>
              <img
                src={`${baseUrl}btp-change-intelligence-overview.png`}
                alt="SAP BTP Change Intelligence dashboard overview with assessment and architecture attention metrics"
                class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
                Dashboard overview — portfolio impact, priority, and architecture attention.
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <img
                src={`${baseUrl}btp-change-intelligence-assessments.png`}
                alt="SAP BTP Change Intelligence latest assessments view with impact, priority, relevance, attention, and confidence"
                class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
                Latest assessments — filter and review changes by impact, priority, relevance, and attention.
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-8 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Structurizr Architecture Diagrams</h3>
          <p>
            A sample workflow for generating software architecture diagrams with Structurizr CLI and
            deploying them to GitHub Pages.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/fabianorosa1/structurizr-github-actions-sample"
            class="mt-4 inline-block text-blue-600 hover:underline"
          >
            View on GitHub →
          </a>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-8 transition hover:shadow-lg">
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Quarkus on SAP BTP Cloud Foundry</h3>
          <p>A proof of concept exploring Quarkus deployment in the SAP BTP Cloud Foundry environment.</p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/fabianorosa1/quarkus-sap-btp-cf"
            class="mt-4 inline-block text-blue-600 hover:underline"
          >
            View on GitHub →
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold">Let’s Connect</h2>
      <p class="mb-8 text-xl">The Hague, Netherlands</p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 text-lg">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fabianorosa/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fabianorosa1" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">GitHub</a>
        <a href="mailto:fabianorosa1@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Email</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
